  "question": {
    "text": "In an atom, an electron is moving with a speed of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>600</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>/</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></math> with an accuracy of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>005</mn><mo>%</mo></math>. Certainty with which the position of the electron can be located is (<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>34</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kg</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>, mass of electron,&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>31</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kg</mi></math>)"
  },
